<view class="page">
  <view class="header"><view><text class="brand">卡密大王</text><view class="subtitle">数字商品 · 邮箱交付</view></view></view>
  <block wx:if="{{!order}}">
    <view class="tabs"><button data-category="muse" bindtap="category" class="{{category==='muse'?'active':''}}">Muse 账号</button><button data-category="token" bindtap="category" class="{{category==='token'?'active':''}}">Muse Token</button><button data-category="gpt" bindtap="category" class="{{category==='gpt'?'active':''}}">GPT</button></view>
    <view class="section"><view class="section-title">选择商品</view><view wx:for="{{plans}}" wx:key="id" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="select" class="plan {{selected===index?'selected':''}}"><view><text class="name">{{item.title}}</text><view wx:if="{{item.detail}}" class="description">{{item.detail}}</view></view><text class="price">¥{{item.price}}</text></view></view>
    <view class="section"><view class="section-title">填写信息</view><view wx:if="{{category==='token'}}"><text class="label">账号邀请码</text><input data-field="inviteCode" value="{{inviteCode}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="填写需要充值的账号邀请码"/></view><text class="label">收件邮箱</text><input data-field="email" value="{{email}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="填写接收订单通知的邮箱"/><text class="hint">请核对邮箱；账号和卡密会发送到这里。</text><view class="label">付款方式</view><view class="methods"><button data-value="wechat" bindtap="method" class="{{method==='wechat'?'chosen':''}}">微信</button><button data-value="alipay" bindtap="method" class="{{method==='alipay'?'chosen':''}}">支付宝</button></view>
    <checkbox-group wx:if="{{category==='gpt' && plans[selected].id==='halfPriceTopup'}}" bindchange="eligible"><label class="check"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{eligible}}"/>我确认账号已有半价资格</label></checkbox-group><checkbox-group bindchange="agree"><label class="check"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{accepted}}"/>我已阅读商品说明并同意购买须知</label></checkbox-group><view class="notice">店主确认收款后处理订单。Muse 成品账号仅保障首次登录；各商品的时效与售后条件请见上方说明。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="create">确认订单 · ¥{{plans[selected].price}}</button></view>
    <view wx:if="{{history.length}}" class="section"><view class="section-title">我的订单</view><view wx:for="{{history}}" wx:key="id" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="openHistory" class="history">{{item.code}} · {{item.title}} →</view></view><view class="footer">联系支持 QQ：3557785836</view>
  </block>
  <block wx:else><button class="back" bindtap="back">← 返回商店</button><view class="section"><view class="section-title">订单 {{order.code}}</view><view class="description">{{order.title}}</view><view class="amount">¥{{order.amountCents / 100}}</view><view class="notice">订单状态：{{order.statusLabel}}。付款后由店主核实收款，不会自动确认到账。</view><view wx:if="{{order.stockIssue}}" class="error">商品暂时缺货，请留意邮箱通知或联系店主。</view><block wx:if="{{order.status==='pending' || order.status==='expired'}}"><view class="label">付款备注请填写订单码</view><view class="order-code">{{order.code}}</view><button bindtap="copyCode">复制订单码</button><view class="hint">支付时手动填写订单金额并粘贴备注。超时后付款请联系店主核查。</view><button wx:if="{{order.status==='pending'}}" class="primary" bindtap="qr">打开{{order.method==='wechat'?'微信':'支付宝'}}收款码</button><button bindtap="report" disabled="{{busy}}">我已付款，通知店主核对</button></block><button bindtap="refresh" disabled="{{busy}}">刷新订单状态</button><view class="hint">完整订单号：{{order.id}}。请保存订单号；交付信息将发送到下单邮箱。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view></view></block>
</view>
